# Vehicle endpoints — implemented
#
# Base URL: pick the one matching how you are running the API.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
# @baseUrl = http://schedule-visits.test/api/v1

### List all vehicles -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles
Accept: application/json

### Get a single vehicle -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1
Accept: application/json

### Get the other seeded vehicle -> 200
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/2
Accept: application/json

### Unknown vehicle -> 404 (thrown by the controller)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/9999
Accept: application/json

### Non-numeric id -> 404 (rejected by the {id:\d+} route, never reaches the controller)
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/abc
Accept: application/json

### Wrong method on an existing route -> 405 with allowed_methods
POST {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Unknown route -> 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/unknown
Accept: application/json

### Accents come back unescaped thanks to JSON_UNESCAPED_UNICODE ("São Paulo - SP")
GET {{baseUrl}}/vehicles/1
Accept: application/json
